## Implementation order

1. The dependencies of § 11
2. `GraphQlLimits`, `GraphQlConfig`, `GraphQlExceptionResolver` in the GraphQL package — once per project
3. The schema file of § 2
4. The adapter records, `OrderGraphQlMapper`, `OrderCursors`, `OrderGraphQlController` — after the ports of § 1 and § 5 exist
5. Properties in `application.yml`
6. Tests — `40-testes.md`: every row of § 10, and the schema snapshot
